  "data": {
    "parameterized": true,
    "summary": "This ability is always written Scouts X\". During Resolve Pre-battle Abilities, a unit whose models all have it may take exactly one of three options. (1) A unit in Strategic Reserves can be set up anywhere wholly within your own deployment zone. (2) A unit standing wholly within your own deployment zone may perform a Scout move under 24.32. (3) A unit aboard a DEDICATED TRANSPORT that stands wholly within your own deployment zone, where every model aboard that DEDICATED TRANSPORT has Scouts, lets that DEDICATED TRANSPORT perform a Scout move.",
